{"ocrText": "V.  I.  LENIN\n164\n*  *  *\nBut,  we  are  told,  there  was  shooting.\nYes, there was. But who did the shooting? Who dares\nblame  it  on  anyone  without  an  investigation?\nPlease  listen  to  a  witness  from  bourgeois  quarters.\nThis witness is the paper Birzheviye Vedomosti, evening\nedition of July 4\u2014a witness whom nobody in the world\ncould suspect of partiality towards the Bolsheviks! Here\nis  what  the  witness  says:\n\u201cAt 2 p.m. sharp, when the armed demonstrators were passing the\nSadovaya and Nevsky corner and a large number of spectators were\nwatching them quietly, a deafening shot rang out from the right side\nof  Sadovaya,  after  which  disorderly  firing  began.\u201d\nAnd so, even the witness from the bourgeois paper is\ncompelled to admit the truth, namely, that the shooting\nbegan from the right side of Sadovaya!! Surely this is a clear\nenough indication that the shooting was aimed at the dem-\nonstrators.\nIs it really so difficult to appreciate that if the demon-\nstrators had planned or wished to use force, they would\nhave sent people against a definite institution, as Polovtsev\nsent military cadets and Cossacks against Pravda? Since\nsailors were killed, and since the witness from the bourgeois\npaper says that the shooting was started \u201cfrom the right\nside of Sadovaya\u201d \u201cwhen the armed demonstrators were\npassing\u201d, isn\u2019t this obvious enough proof that it was the\nBlack Hundreds, the opponents of democracy, the quarters\nclose to the Cadets, that wanted and were bent on violence?\nWritten  on  July  5  (18),  1917\nPublished  in  Listok  \u201cPravdy\u201d,\nPublished  according  to\nJuly  19   (6),  1917\nthe  newspaper  text", "textLayer": [{"text": "V.  I.  LENIN", "x": 44.62, "y": 6.11, "w": 13.0, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "164", "x": 11.11, "y": 6.06, "w": 3.33, "h": 1.56, "fontSize": 9.2}, {"text": "*  *  *", "x": 47.44, "y": 9.93, "w": 7.36, "h": 3.16, "fontSize": 13.0}, {"text": "But,  we  are  told,  there  was  shooting.", "x": 13.9, "y": 13.14, "w": 52.52, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "Yes, there was. But who did the shooting? Who dares", "x": 13.9, "y": 15.08, "w": 77.22, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "blame  it  on  anyone  without  an  investigation?", "x": 11.11, "y": 17.02, "w": 57.4, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "Please  listen  to", "x": 13.9, "y": 18.94, "w": 21.71, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "a  witness  from  bourgeois  quarters", "x": 35.64, "y": 18.96, "w": 46.65, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": ".", "x": 82.37, "y": 18.94, "w": 0.73, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "This witness is the paper", "x": 13.9, "y": 20.88, "w": 35.36, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "Birzheviye Vedomosti", "x": 49.75, "y": 20.9, "w": 28.96, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": ", evening", "x": 78.81, "y": 20.88, "w": 12.29, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "edition of July 4\u2014a witness whom nobody in the world", "x": 11.11, "y": 22.82, "w": 80.01, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "could suspect of partiality towards the Bolsheviks! Here", "x": 11.11, "y": 24.76, "w": 80.0, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "is  what  the  witness  says:", "x": 11.11, "y": 26.7, "w": 35.31, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "\u201cAt 2 p.m. sharp, when the armed demonstrators were passing the", "x": 13.9, "y": 29.51, "w": 77.23, "h": 1.52, "fontSize": 9.0}, {"text": "Sadovaya and Nevsky corner and a large number of spectators were", "x": 11.11, "y": 31.09, "w": 80.01, "h": 1.52, "fontSize": 9.0}, {"text": "watching them quietly,", "x": 11.11, "y": 32.66, "w": 26.6, "h": 1.52, "fontSize": 9.0}, {"text": "a deafening shot rang out from the right side", "x": 38.16, "y": 32.68, "w": 52.96, "h": 1.52, "fontSize": 9.0}, {"text": "of", "x": 11.11, "y": 34.27, "w": 3.48, "h": 1.52, "fontSize": 9.0}, {"text": "S", "x": 14.73, "y": 34.33, "w": 1.32, "h": 1.44, "fontSize": 8.5}, {"text": "adovaya", "x": 16.09, "y": 34.27, "w": 9.16, "h": 1.52, "fontSize": 9.0}, {"text": ",  after  which  disorderly  firing  began.\u201d", "x": 25.39, "y": 34.26, "w": 45.32, "h": 1.52, "fontSize": 9.0}, {"text": "And so, even the witness from the bourgeois paper is", "x": 13.9, "y": 36.64, "w": 77.23, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "compelled to admit the truth, namely, that the shooting", "x": 11.11, "y": 38.58, "w": 80.0, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "began from the right side of", "x": 11.11, "y": 40.54, "w": 37.45, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "S", "x": 48.98, "y": 40.61, "w": 1.62, "h": 1.76, "fontSize": 10.4}, {"text": "adovaya", "x": 50.67, "y": 40.54, "w": 10.39, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "!! Surely this is a clear", "x": 61.1, "y": 40.52, "w": 30.02, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "enough indication that the shooting was aimed", "x": 11.11, "y": 42.46, "w": 64.12, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "at the dem-", "x": 75.7, "y": 42.47, "w": 15.41, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "onstrators.", "x": 11.11, "y": 44.41, "w": 14.48, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "Is it really so difficult to appreciate that if the demon-", "x": 13.9, "y": 46.32, "w": 77.23, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "strators had planned or wished to use force,", "x": 11.11, "y": 48.25, "w": 64.05, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "they would", "x": 75.91, "y": 48.27, "w": 15.22, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "have sent people against a definite institution", "x": 11.11, "y": 50.21, "w": 61.6, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": ", as Polovtsev", "x": 72.8, "y": 50.19, "w": 18.33, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "sent military cadets and Cossacks against", "x": 11.11, "y": 52.13, "w": 59.55, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "Pravda", "x": 71.35, "y": 52.15, "w": 9.71, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "? Since", "x": 81.19, "y": 52.13, "w": 9.92, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "sailors were killed, and since the witness from the bourgeois", "x": 11.11, "y": 54.07, "w": 80.0, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "paper says that the shooting was started \u201cfrom the right", "x": 11.11, "y": 56.01, "w": 80.0, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "side of Sadovaya\u201d \u201cwhen the armed demonstrators were", "x": 11.11, "y": 57.93, "w": 80.0, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "passing\u201d, isn\u2019t this obvious enough proof that it was", "x": 11.11, "y": 59.87, "w": 75.34, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "the", "x": 87.11, "y": 59.89, "w": 3.99, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "Black Hundreds", "x": 11.11, "y": 61.83, "w": 21.88, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": ",", "x": 33.1, "y": 61.81, "w": 1.55, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "the opponents", "x": 35.14, "y": 61.83, "w": 19.19, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "of democracy, the quarters", "x": 54.81, "y": 61.81, "w": 36.31, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "close to the Cadets, that wanted and were bent on violence?", "x": 11.11, "y": 63.75, "w": 80.01, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "Written", "x": 12.3, "y": 67.62, "w": 7.58, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "on", "x": 20.77, "y": 67.62, "w": 2.27, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "July", "x": 23.97, "y": 67.62, "w": 3.99, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "5", "x": 28.86, "y": 67.68, "w": 0.94, "h": 1.28, "fontSize": 7.6}, {"text": "(", "x": 30.81, "y": 67.62, "w": 0.67, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "18", "x": 31.61, "y": 67.68, "w": 1.9, "h": 1.28, "fontSize": 7.6}, {"text": "),", "x": 33.75, "y": 67.62, "w": 1.33, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "1917", "x": 36.0, "y": 67.68, "w": 3.95, "h": 1.28, "fontSize": 7.6}, {"text": "Published", "x": 11.11, "y": 69.48, "w": 9.43, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "in", "x": 21.45, "y": 69.48, "w": 1.84, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "Listok", "x": 24.21, "y": 69.49, "w": 6.16, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "\u201c", "x": 31.26, "y": 69.48, "w": 1.07, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "Pravdy", "x": 32.44, "y": 69.49, "w": 7.01, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "\u201d,", "x": 39.59, "y": 69.48, "w": 1.72, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "Published", "x": 68.24, "y": 69.48, "w": 9.43, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "according", "x": 78.58, "y": 69.48, "w": 9.36, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "to", "x": 88.83, "y": 69.48, "w": 1.82, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "July", "x": 18.1, "y": 70.84, "w": 3.99, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "19", "x": 22.99, "y": 70.89, "w": 1.91, "h": 1.28, "fontSize": 7.6}, {"text": "(", "x": 25.96, "y": 70.84, "w": 0.67, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "6", "x": 26.76, "y": 70.89, "w": 0.95, "h": 1.28, "fontSize": 7.6}, {"text": "),", "x": 27.94, "y": 70.84, "w": 1.33, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "1917", "x": 30.16, "y": 70.89, "w": 3.95, "h": 1.28, "fontSize": 7.6}, {"text": "the", "x": 70.1, "y": 70.84, "w": 2.97, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "newspaper", "x": 73.99, "y": 70.84, "w": 10.21, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "text", "x": 85.13, "y": 70.84, "w": 3.67, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}]}